# Raw, regenerable simulation output stays out of git (the sibling
# electron_thruster repo once tracked 95 GB of dumps).  Small provenance
# files remain tracked: outputs/**/config_used.yaml + used_inputs.txt,
# results/ PNGs, summary JSONs and small CSVs.
**/outputs/**/*.h5
**/outputs/**/*.bp
**/outputs/**/chk*/
**/outputs/**/reducedfiles/
**/__pycache__/
*.log
# Large binary media (regenerable via the animate scripts)
**/results/*.mp4
**/results/*.gif
